# CRA reads REACT_APP_* at **build time**. Rebuild the frontend image after changes.
#
# Docker (recommended): leave empty or comment out — the app calls same-origin `/api` and nginx proxies to the API
# (works for both http://localhost:8080 and https://localhost:8443 without mixed-content errors).
#
# VPS / split hosts: set the public API origin (no trailing slash), e.g. https://api.hospital.example.org
#
# REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=

REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://your-api-domain.example.com
